[00:24.86]Baby we don’t even need any music
{"宝贝 我们甚至不需要音乐"}
[00:27.96]Cause we make the beat when we moving
{"因舞步自会踏出节拍"}
[00:29.86]You know that it’s making me hot, hot, hot
{"你明白这让我多燥热 燥热 燥热"}
[00:32.20]We belong to the night, we belong to the music
{"我们属于夜晚 属于音乐"}
[00:35.54]So let’s live in the moment of freedom that will get you wild
{"就在自由的瞬间纵情狂欢"}
[00:39.51]Let’s ignite this fire up, across the world we take it up
{"点燃这簇火焰 让激情席卷全球"}
[00:44.98]Let me hear you screaming out loud
